config BR2_PACKAGE_IPCTOOL
	bool "ipctool"
	depends on BR2_SOC_SIGMASTAR
	help
	  OpenIPC's IP-camera hardware identification tool. Installs
	  `ipcinfo`, which reports the SoC, the flash chip and -- the reason
	  this board wants it -- the sensor actually attached, probed over
	  i2c rather than read from a stored variable.

	  load_sigmastar falls back to `ipcinfo -s` when the U-Boot `sensor`
	  variable is unset, which is what makes one image work on any board
	  of this model instead of only on boards whose OEM set the variable.

	  https://github.com/openipc/ipctool
